@startuml
title State diagram for the Safehome Security Function

[*] --> InitialCheck : power-on

state "Initial Check" as InitialCheck
state "Problem During Startup" as ProblemDuringStartup
state "Ready to Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm and Alert" as AlarmAndAlert
state "Normal State" as NormalState

InitialCheck --> ProblemDuringStartup : problem during startup
ProblemDuringStartup --> [*] : stop

InitialCheck --> ReadyToUse : everything fine during startup
ReadyToUse --> Reset : reset by user
Reset --> InitialCheck : reset complete

ReadyToUse --> Activate : activate by user
Activate --> Monitoring : start monitoring

Monitoring --> AlarmAndAlert : sensor triggered during monitoring
AlarmAndAlert --> NormalState : false alarm or time ends

NormalState --> ReadyToUse : enter password at any time

@enduml
